      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "letters",
          "heading": "Two more signs: ి makes a short \"i\" and ీ makes a long \"ee\". క + ి = కి (ki), క + ీ = కీ (kee).",
          "note": "Tap a big letter to hear it. Trace the light letters.",
